                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "look man. either you like walking sims or you don't. It's either a genre or a derogatory term, and this is about as pure and minimalistic an example as you can come across. If you aren't sold on the premise you're probably not going to get anything out of it; if you're expecting Death Stranding, you're not getting anything out of it. Moving past that, still don't know? I think this can be a very gainful experience if you're just willing to hear it out. \n\nalso shoutout viridi",
